#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "found in %s"
msgstr "löytyi kohteesta %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:134
msgctxt "web"
msgid "none found"
msgstr "ei löytynyt"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:135
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Which game it is (Steam app ID: %s)"
msgstr "Mikä peli se on (Steam app ID: %s)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:135
msgctxt "web"
msgid "none"
msgstr "ei mitään"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:136
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Steam app ID, e.g. 1091500"
msgstr "Steam app ID, esim. 1091500"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:139 title/pc5_web_page.html:165
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Tallenna"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:142 title/pc5_web_page.html:168
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saving…"
msgstr "Tallennetaan…"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:146
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Saved: its cover, background and details are fetched again when PC5 opens."
msgstr ""
"Tallennettu: sen kansikuva, tausta ja tiedot haetaan uudelleen, kun PC5 "
"avautuu."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:147
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Cleared: PC5 reads the game's folder again."
msgstr "Tyhjennetty: PC5 lukee pelin kansion uudelleen."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:149 title/pc5_web_page.html:174
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Not saved: %s"
msgstr "Ei tallennettu: %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:152
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "; GOG product %s"
msgstr "; GOG-tuote %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:153
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"PC5 picks the game's cover, background and details by this number (%s%s). "
"If they are another game's, type the number from the game's Steam store "
"link (store.steampowered.com/app/<number>). Empty: PC5 reads the folder "
"again."
msgstr ""
"PC5 valitsee pelin kansikuvan, taustan ja tiedot tämän numeron perusteella "
"(%s%s). Jos ne kuuluvat toiseen peliin, kirjoita numero pelin Steam-kaupan "
"linkistä (store.steampowered.com/app/<numero>). Tyhjä: PC5 lukee kansion "
"uudelleen."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:172
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Saved: used at the game's next start."
msgstr "Tallennettu: käytetään pelin seuraavassa käynnistyksessä."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:187
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No games yet."
msgstr "Ei vielä pelejä."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:190
msgctxt "web"
msgid "USB drive"
msgstr "USB-asema"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:191
msgctxt "web"
msgid "can't start"
msgstr "ei käynnisty"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:196
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Settings: %s"
msgstr "Asetukset: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:199
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Newest log"
msgstr "Uusin loki"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:201
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "Ilmoita ongelmasta"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:202
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Downloads the newest log and opens GitHub's form, filled in: attach the "
"log there."
msgstr ""
"Lataa uusimman lokin ja avaa GitHubin valmiiksi täytetyn lomakkeen: liitä "
"loki sinne."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:208
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Launch options (launch.txt)"
msgstr "Käynnistysvalinnat (launch.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:209
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"The first line that isn't empty or a comment (# or ;) is added to the "
"program's command line."
msgstr ""
"Ensimmäinen rivi, joka ei ole tyhjä tai kommentti (# tai ;), lisätään "
"ohjelman komentoriville."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:212
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Environment variables (env.txt)"
msgstr "Ympäristömuuttujat (env.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:212
msgctxt "web"
msgid "One NAME=value a line, set before the game starts."
msgstr "Yksi NIMI=arvo riviä kohden, asetetaan ennen pelin käynnistymistä."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:213
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Extra logging (winedebug.txt)"
msgstr "Lisälokitus (winedebug.txt)"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:214
msgctxt "web"
msgid ""
"Only when an issue asks for it, for example err+all,+seh. Empty it "
"afterwards: it slows the game down."
msgstr ""
"Vain kun issue pyytää sitä, esimerkiksi err+all,+seh. Tyhjennä se "
"jälkeenpäin: se hidastaa peliä."

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:219
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The games didn't load: %s"
msgstr "Pelit eivät latautuneet: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:232
msgctxt "web"
msgid "No logs kept."
msgstr "Lokeja ei ole säilytetty."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:236
msgctxt "web"
msgid "had a problem"
msgstr "oli ongelma"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:239
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "The logs didn't load: %s"
msgstr "Lokit eivät latautuneet: %s"

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:248
msgctxt "web"
msgid "the connection was lost"
msgstr "yhteys katkesi"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:265
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Sending %d of %d: %s"
msgstr "Lähetetään %d/%d: %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:269
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Stopped at %s: %s"
msgstr "Pysähtyi kohdassa %s: %s"

#. Web page text.
#. %s and %d are filled in by the page; %1$s, %2$s put them in another order.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:276
#, c-format
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Sent %d files (%s). PC5 asks to install the game in a moment."
msgstr "Lähetetty %d tiedostoa (%s). PC5 kysyy pian, asennetaanko peli."

#. Web page text.
#: title/pc5_web_page.html:285
msgctxt "web"
msgid "Type the game's folder name first (no / or \\)."
msgstr "Kirjoita ensin pelin kansion nimi (ei / tai \\)."
